<title>USA: Two dead in military plane crash in Colorado.</title>
<headline>Two dead in military plane crash in Colorado.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two military personnel were killed Wednesday in the crash of an Air Force Academy training airplane near the academy, Colorado Springs police said.</p>
<p>The single-engine propeller plane caught fire after crashing, but there were no other injuries or property damage, Lt. Steve Liebowitz at the scene told Reuters.</p>
<p>Few details were immediately available, including the identity of the personnel.</p>
